/codex-1
# ψ/ vault: ignore by default, but ψ/teams/ is tracked (charters, ledger, drift-test).
# Must be `ψ/*` not `ψ/` — git cannot re-include inside a directory excluded as a whole.
ψ/*
!ψ/teams/
# ψ/memory/: ต้อง re-include ตัวโฟลเดอร์ก่อน git ถึงจะเดินเข้าไปได้
# แล้วค่อยปิดข้างในทั้งหมด แล้วเปิดเฉพาะ 2 อันที่ต้องการ (mailbox/, resonance/ ยังปิด)
!ψ/memory/
ψ/memory/*
!ψ/memory/learnings/
!ψ/memory/retrospectives/
# 🩹 2026-08-07 — root-cause fix for a friction at threshold 3 (session-metrics rows 144/172/239).
#    Every durable relay message had to be `git add -f`'d by hand — ~25 times in one session —
#    and the fix was written as a Next Step twice (2026-08-04 09:32 #2, 03:07 #5) and never done.
#    Per CLAUDE.md Self-Evaluation Loop: same friction 3 sessions -> fix the root cause.
!ψ/inbox/
# 🩹 2026-08-07 — ψ/archive/ is where "Nothing is Deleted" sends retired work. Excluding it made
#    the archive durable per-session only, not per-history — the same defect the ψ/inbox/ line above
#    fixed. Found while closing Next Step #5 (a backup whose only copy lived in /tmp).
!ψ/archive/

# git worktrees created by Claude Code (embedded repos — never commit as gitlinks)
.claude/worktrees/
